✅ **Use Spring Batch** for structured ETL.
✅ **Optimize data extraction & transformation** (chunk processing, parallelization).
✅ **Implement logging, error handling, and retry mechanisms.**
✅ **Automate scheduling & monitoring** with Prometheus, Actuator, and Quartz.
