### **🚀 HATEOAS Implementation in Spring Boot**

#### **1️⃣ Add Dependencies**

Include Spring HATEOAS in `pom.xml`:

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-hateoas</artifactId>
